<section class="hero wrap" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="hero-title">Thoughtful ideas.<br /><em>Useful things.</em></h1><p>
      I’m Shaun, a product-minded developer.<br />I turn real-world problems
      into websites,<br class="desktop-break" /> tools, and AI-powered products.
    </p><div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button" href="#work">Explore my work <span>↘</span></a><a
        class="text-link"
        href="mailto:shaun@a-dobe.club">Let’s talk ↗</a
      >
    </div><div class="location">
      <span></span> Based in Christchurch, New Zealand
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="computer-stage" id="computer-stage">
    <div class="orbit-label">A small window into my world.</div><a
      class="computer"
      id="computer"
      href="/terminal"
      data-terminal
      aria-label="Open the interactive terminal to ask about Shaun's work"
      ><div class="monitor">
        <div class="monitor-side"></div><div class="monitor-front">
          <div class="screen">
            <div class="screen-top">
              <span>shaun@portfolio</span><span>~</span>
            </div><div class="screen-content">
              <span class="screen-greeting">Hello, curious human.</span><p>
                Good things start<br />with a conversation.
              </p><div class="screen-prompt">
                <span>&gt;</span> ask me anything<span class="cursor">_</span>
              </div>
            </div><div class="screen-bottom">
              <span>PRODUCT THINKING × BUILDING</span><span>↗</span>
            </div>
          </div><div class="monitor-chin">
            <span class="computer-brand">s.</span><span class="power-light"
            ></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div><div class="monitor-neck"></div><div class="monitor-foot"></div><div
        class="keyboard"
      >
        <div class="keys">
          {
            Array.from({ length: 36 }, (_, i) => (
              <span class={i === 32 ? "space-key" : ""} />
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div></a
    ><div class="desk-shadow"></div><div class="computer-caption">
      <span class="caption-line"></span><a
        class="caption-button"
        href="/terminal"
        data-terminal
        aria-label="Open the interactive terminal"
        >Go on, say hello.<span class="caption-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span
        ></a
      >
    </div>
  </div><div class="hero-bottom">
    <span>From the first question to the final detail.</span><span
      >SELECTED WORK BELOW ↓</span
    >
  </div>
</section>
